WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.050
One last spelling check.

00:00:02.050 --> 00:00:05.930
Read your piece out loud and touch each long word.

00:00:05.930 --> 00:00:08.010
Find the part you know.

00:00:08.010 --> 00:00:09.690
Check the ending.

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:13.140
If a word looks strange, it probably is.

00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:17.320
Fix it now, and your best piece stays your best.
